Z||000019||William||11-20-2000||11:44 PM||||Well, after reading this thread Saturday morning, I rushed out after lunch and picked one up! Actually, as I didn't really want the remote or alarm feature, I picked up the identical dehp 47dh model. I am completely satisfied with this purchase. I did not want a complicated contest system with amps and subs but rather a good sounding unit with plenty of power for upgraded stock style speakers. As night fell I was treated to this units display lighting up the dark interior of the car. Wow, it does look sharp at night and how about the "black light" around the eq selector! Feels kinda like a x-wing fighter now.... No, it's not red but I couldn't care less||||reg||1
